OL,3,ATwo Britons among three killed in Swiss
OL,4,AAlps light aircraft crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Britons are among three people
OL,7,Fkilled in a plane crash in the Swiss
OL,8,FAlps.
OL,10,FThe light aircraft crashed high in the
OL,11,Fmountains near the town of Leukerbad in
OL,12,Fthe southern canton of Valais on
OL,13,FTuesday.
OL,15,FThe authorities said the Cirrus SR22T
OL,16,Ftook off from Sion airport in the Rhone
OL,17,FValley and, for unknown reasons,
OL,18,Fcollided with a mountain slope about 10
OL,19,Fminutes later.
OL,21,FWitnesses reported seeing a fire and
OL,22,Fsmoke.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
